=Extract invoice data from this email. Reply with ONLY a JSON object, no prose:
{"vendor": string, "amount": number, "currency": string, "invoice_number": string, "invoice_date": string, "due_date": string}
Use "" for unknown fields. If this email is not an invoice or receipt, reply exactly: NOT_INVOICE

From: {{ $json.from }}
Subject: {{ $json.subject }}

{{ $json.text }}

